                      (       cocovtio.d):00191         ********************************************************************
                      (       cocovtio.d):00192         * VTIODefs - Video Terminal I/O Definitions for CoCo 3
                      (       cocovtio.d):00193         *
                      (       cocovtio.d):00194         * Edt/Rev  YYYY/MM/DD  Modified by
                      (       cocovtio.d):00195         * Comment
                      (       cocovtio.d):00196         * ------------------------------------------------------------------
                      (       cocovtio.d):00197         *          2004/07/18  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (       cocovtio.d):00198         * Started from systype
                      (       cocovtio.d):00199         *          2020/07/14  L. Curtis Boyle
                      (       cocovtio.d):00200         * EOU Beta 6 added defs, removed G.KeyEnt (2 bytes), G.KeyMem (8 bytes) static mem buffer,
                      (       cocovtio.d):00201         *   as Keydrv has been merged back into VTIO to save some system RAM and CC3 Global Mem.
                      (       cocovtio.d):00202         *   Added labels for the buffered write routines for SCF and GRFDRV as well.
                      (       cocovtio.d):00203         *   (There appears to still be room for a CoVDG buffer as well, if we want to add one)
                      (       cocovtio.d):00204                             NAM       VTIODefs
                      (       cocovtio.d):00205                             TTL       Video               Terminal I/O Definitions for CoCo 3
                      (       cocovtio.d):00206         
                      (       cocovtio.d):00207         * Max size of Get/Put buffer to copy between user and grfdrv. There is room for up to 128, but
                      (       cocovtio.d):00208         *   we may use some of that for other things. Leaving at OS-9 Level II default (72) for now.
                      (       cocovtio.d):00209         * May try increasing to higher (maybe 96?) to see if it makes a noticable difference GPLoading
                      (       cocovtio.d):00210         * fonts, etc. in EOU bootup.
                      (       cocovtio.d):00211         
     0048             (       cocovtio.d):00212         gb0000              EQU       72                  Size of get/put buffer ($48)
     0180             (       cocovtio.d):00213         FstGrfBf            EQU       $0180               Address of fast grfdrv text buffer
                      (       cocovtio.d):00214                             IFNE      H6309
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00215         FstGrfSz            EQU       64                  Size of fast grfdrv text buffer (6309)
                      (       cocovtio.d):00216                             ELSE
     0020             (       cocovtio.d):00217         FstGrfSz            EQU       32                  Size of fast grfdrv text buffer (6809)
                      (       cocovtio.d):00218                             ENDC
                      (       cocovtio.d):00219         
